### Dashboard Component Architecture

**Component Hierarchy:**

```
Dashboard (main)
├── MetricsSummary (overall stats)
├── FilterBar (filter controls)
├── IssueList (navigation)
│   ├── IssueItem (individual issue)
│   └── SeverityBadge (color coding)
├── IssueDetails (expanded view)
